    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 2 studies in children: lymph node specimens with a microbiological reference standard. Both studies show sensitivity 1.00; specificity is 0.82 (Zar 2018-2023) and 0.33 (Aurilio 2022).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
